Inspect and operate the bundled platform analytics, gateway, and observability stack. These commands require admin/operator Kubernetes access with kubectl; normal users should use the platform API and dashboard instead.

Usage:
  mcp-runtime ops [command]

Available Commands:
  events       Show recent Kubernetes events for the platform namespaces
  grafana      Diagnose and recover bundled Grafana admin credentials
  logs         View logs for a platform component
  port-forward Port-forward a common platform service
  restart      Restart one or all platform workloads
  status       Show platform stack status

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for ops

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging

Use "mcp-runtime ops [command] --help" for more information about a command.
